 disease associated with the 2014-2015 chikungunya outbreak in the U.S. Virgin Islands[J]. PLoS Negl Trop Dis, 2019, 13(7): e7563-72.] [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 46. 于 保荣, 许 晴, 刘 卓, et al. 新发传染病经济负担的方法学研究. http://d.old.wanfangdata.com.cn/Periodical/wsjjyj201707007 . 卫生经济研究. 2017;36(7):25–9. [于保荣, 许晴, 刘卓, 等.新发传染病经济负担的方法学研究[J].卫生经济研究, 2017, 36(7): 25-9.] [ Google Scholar ] 47. Beutels P, Edmunds WJ, Antonanzas F, et al. Economic evaluation of vaccination programmes: a consensus statement focusing on viral hepatitis. http://core.ac.uk/display/13099790 . Pharmacoeconomics. 2002;20(1):1–7. doi: 10.2165/00019053-200220010-00001. [Beutels P, Edmunds WJ, Antonanzas F, et al. Economic evaluation of vaccination programmes: a consensus statement focusing on viral hepatitis[J]. Pharmacoeconomics, 2002, 20(1): 1-7.] [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 48. Li L, Liu Y, Wu P, et al. Influenza-associated excess respiratory mortality in China, 2010-15: a population-based study. Lancet Public Health. 2019;4(9):e473–81. doi: 10.1016/S2468-2667(19)30163-X. [Li L, Liu Y, Wu P, et al. Influenza-associated excess respiratory mortality in China, 2010-15: a population-based study[J]. Lancet Public Health, 2019, 4(9): e473-81.] [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 49. Qi X, Jiang D, Wang H, et al. Calculating the burden of disease of avian-origin H7N9 infections in China. http://www.wanfangdata.com.cn/details/detail.do?_type=perio&id=HighWire000006266563 . BMJ Open. 2014;4(1):e4189–96. doi: 10.1136/bmjopen-2013-004189. [Qi X, Jiang D, Wang H, et al. Calculating the burden of disease of avian-origin H7N9 infections in China[J]. BMJ Open, 2014, 4(1): e4189-96.] [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 50. 马 旺, 霍 翔, 周 明浩. 急性呼吸道传染病疾病负担及评价方法研究进展. http://d.old.wanfangdata.com.cn/Periodical/zgggws201702026 . 中国公共卫生. 2017;33(2):266–70. [马旺, 霍翔, 周明浩.急性呼吸道传染病疾病负担及评价方法研究进展[J].中国公共卫生, 2017, 33(2): 266-70.] [ Google Scholar ]',221,